{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42475","headline":"寄山中高逸人 · 孟贯","name":"寄山中高逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟霞多放旷，吟啸是寻常。\n猨共摘山果，僧邻住石房。\n蹑云双屐冷，采药一身香。\n我忆相逢夜，松潭月色凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}